  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"加载器\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.1 | 1.21-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"可用版本\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8&amp;labelColor=6A7EC2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"赞助\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://iron431.github.io/Irons-Spellbooks-Docs/img/spellbooks-title-small-background.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p><p>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks 为游戏带来了经典RPG施法幻想体验。与危险的巫师战斗，探索大量结构，深入地下城，收集资源和法术，并找到强大的魔法物品！</p><hr><h2>特色包括：</h2><ul>\n<li>超过100种可升级法术</li>\n<li>2个施法Boss</li>\n<li>9个施法敌人/盟友/商人</li>\n<li>12套巫师护甲</li>\n<li>11个随机生成的结构</li>\n<li>武器附魔和护甲升级系统</li>\n<li>广泛的配置选项（包括每个法术的设置）</li>\n<li>原生支持JEI、JEED、Apotheosis、Tetra、Better Combat、Patchouli等模组</li>\n<li>还有更多精彩内容！</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>常见问题解答：</h2><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：如何开始使用Spells 'n Spellbooks？</strong></span><br>\n答：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.iron.wiki%252fprogression%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.iron.wiki/progression/</a></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：是否会移植到1.20.1（或其他版本/模组加载器）？</strong></span><br>\n答：简短回答：不会。这些模组是个人爱好项目，为单一版本开发需要<em>数月</em>的个人投入。但它们是开源的，欢迎社区贡献：<a href=\"https://github.com/iron431/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/iron431/</a>。早期访问版本可通过Patreon获取(<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/Iron431</a>)</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：我的模型损坏/无法渲染</strong></span><br>\n答：如果安装有Optifine，那就是原因。Optifine是为原版客户端设计的。请使用众多替代品（如Oculus）配合Forge使用</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/echo_of_the_flamebearer.png\" alt=\"泰罗斯\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/inscription_table.png\" alt=\"铭文台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/scroll_forge.png\" alt=\"卷轴锻造台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/structures.png\" alt=\"结构\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/magic_loot.png\" alt=\"魔法战利品\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/ancient_city_loot.png\" alt=\"远古城市战利品\"></p><hr><h2>开发者信息：</h2><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firon.wiki%252fdevelopers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://iron.wiki/developers</a></span></p><hr><h2>支持我们：</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon赞助\"></a></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/ad/essential.jpg\" alt=\"Essential\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252firon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1b3bc821-298d-4efc-96d2-7dff77d7069a.png\" alt=\"Bisect\"></a></p>",
